WEBVTT

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.970
Now, now, overeating is bad, so that's enough.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.590
It's bad to overdrink, so no more juice.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.390
Here's your reward for being a good little girl!

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.790
Lancece!

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:41.650
She was going through one heck of a grumpy phase until now, but...

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:44.500
It feels as though she's grown out of it.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:50.110
It's strange. Whenever I see Ai smile...

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.980
It warms my heart...

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.570
And puts a smile on my face!

00:00:56.090 --> 00:01:00.980
With a smile like that, she'll never power up the Selfish!

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:02.980
{OP}

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:09.180
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:11.650
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:14.510
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:16.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:20.230
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:27.140
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:32.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:38.440
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:43.880
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:49.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:58.460
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.130
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:02.530
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:05.370
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.170
What's more than just cute

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:12.060
is our promise between girls

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:18.100
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:23.990
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:30.470
Huh?

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:34.300
What? Why? How To Raise a Child

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:34.300
What? Why? How To Raise a Child

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:34.300
For New Mothers

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:34.300
For New Mothers

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:34.300
You wanna turn that wing sproutin' toddler into a Selfish?

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:35.970
Her <i>name</i> is Ai.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:37.160
What a load.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:38.780
Do it yourse—

