00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.030
Turning her into a Selfish won't be so easy.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.230
I have a plan.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.300
We'll use finger puppets.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:14.810
Bel's Scheme!

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:14.810
Bel's Scheme!

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:22.830
Ai—

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:25.110
Oh, widdle Ai!

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.830
Look up here, widdle Ai!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.780
Boing!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:52.250
Hey there, widdle Ai!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.450
We're your friends!

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.220
It's much too early to sleep!

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:58.080
Let's go out and play!

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:04.660
Let's take a trip to the paradise of dreams!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.180
It'll be fun!

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.660
Come on!

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.370
Time's a-wastin'!

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.370
Kyupirappa!

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.650
This way, Ai!

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.680
Well aren't you peppy, Ai?

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.440
Tonight's no night for sleep, Ai!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.390
Ai, it's morning!

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:35.860
Huh? Ai's always been an early riser.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.530
Here comes the airplane!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.180
You don't want to eat?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.120
Come now, if you don't eat—

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:47.880
No-no.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.070
Is she back in her grumpy phase?

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.970
No-no, no-no!

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.060
Ah!

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.230
Mana, you'll be late for school if you don't hurry!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.170
You're right!

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:00.180
Okay Charles, watch Ai for today!

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.990
You got it!

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:04.610
I'm back!

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:05.620
Whoah!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.330
Charles, what happened?

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.930
Ai wouldn't take her nap,

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:14.600
so I tried to take her toy,

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.690
but she got grumpy and pulled back!

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:23.880
Ai's certainly gotten stronger.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.910
I think she went back to her grumpy phase this morning.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.310
There's something different about Ai!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:32.260
Well, she's still a baby.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:35.020
Babies change and grow with the date.

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.560
<i>There has to be a reason!</i>

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.490
<i>And dangit, I'm going to find it!</i>

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:50.160
<i>Dangit, I'm going to—</i>

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.590
Good morning, Charles.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.340
Dangit, I messed up!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.770
Ai...

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:07.490
Ai's still sound asleep.

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:11.520
Ai, rise and shine!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.490
Oh no!

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:21.410
Ai, that's too much!

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:27.740
I think she's fallen back into her grumpy phase, and hard!

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:30.710
<i>I'll get it tonight!</i>

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.850
Gottastayawake don'tfallasleep youcandoit...

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:43.690
Toy!

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:44.750
Here!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.360
Joose!

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:47.420
Here!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.990
Toy!

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:50.190
Have 'em!

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:52.520
Selfishes do what they want!

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.870
We eat, drink, and play hard!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.210
More!

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.400
Yeah, yeah...

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:03.550
Ain't it great to have your every selfish desire granted?

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:05.570
That's what being a Selfish is like!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.970
Don't you want to be a Selfish, too?

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:13.960
Havin' fun?

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:15.810
Isn't that swell!

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:23.730
<i>It's only a matter of time until Ai becomes a complete Selfish.</i>

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:27.200
<i>And when she does, I'll be powered up all the more!</i>

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.930
<i>The Egogy I'll steal from the human world will be all mine,</i>

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:35.240
<i>and once I obtain the power to overthrow King Selfish...</i>

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.540
<i>I'll promote myself from Number Two Selfish...</i>

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.080
<i>to Numero Uno!</i>

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:49.640
Ai wanted to try bowling...

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.560
Foolishness.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.850
Kyupirappa!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.090
Wh-What?!

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.770
Strike!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:11.880
Nice shot!

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.940
You rule! Do it again!

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.030
Kyupirappa!

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:17.750
No!

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:18.980
Not us!

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:49.180
<i>Just bear with it...</i>

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:51.130
<i>Soon, I'll be...</i>

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.010
Numero...

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:54.830
Uno!

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.560
Huh? Ai was out all night?

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:09.920
Charles said she saw it.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:12.030
Why would Ai do that?

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:16.810
But Ai has been pretty selfish lately...

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:22.610
A lo-lo-love letter?!

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:22.240
Challenge

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:22.360
Challenge

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:23.310
Challenge

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:24.960
A challenge!

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:28.470
"We've been taking care of Ai." {TS 09:43}

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:32.290
"If you want her back, come to the abandoned factory at the edge of town."

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:33.600
"Bel."

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:35.420
Ai was kidnapped?

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.650
We have to save her right away!

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:40.800
But what if it's a trap?

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:43.260
Bel

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.260
Even if it is,

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:46.400
we have to get Ai back!

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:08.040
Where is Ai?

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.860
Stop hiding her!

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:12.230
She's wight here.

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:15.460
Ai!

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:17.690
What's with that getup?

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.210
Ai, come here!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.940
That's a no, toots!

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:24.780
Don't put words into her mouth!

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.030
I ain't!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:27.910
Them's Ai's words, to the letter!

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:33.160
Ai, you have way more fun with us than with them, right?

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:38.350
Ai's turned into a complete Selfish.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:39.820
That can't be true!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.450
Selfishes drink all they want!

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:45.060
Selfishes eat all they want!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.000
So that's it!

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:54.530
You lured Ai out in the middle of the night to turn her into a Selfish!

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:55.710
Correctamundo!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.880
But it's a too late for you to do a thing about it!

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.290
Don't do that, Ai!

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:04.500
Stop it!

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.920
You'll get a tummyache!

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:11.610
Aww, we don't want these scary ladies to get mad, so we'll take those away.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.850
Gibbit! Gibbit!

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.270
I like that selfishness!

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:19.830
Ooh, I see you're filling with Egogy!

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:23.690
We'll take Ai back no matter what!

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.350
Girls, let's go!

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:27.400
Ai!

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:30.550
This'll be dangerous, Aguri, so stay back!

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:34.400
Charles!

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.380
Precure Love Link!

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:39.430
L-O-V-E!

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:40.110
L-O-V-E!

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:40.710
L-O-V-E!

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:41.800
L-O-V-E!

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:00.190
Brimming with love,

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.200
Cure Heart!

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.450
The light of wisdom,

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.800
Cure Diamond!

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.960
The warmth of the sun,

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:15.370
Cure Rosetta!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.140
The blade of courage,

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:20.170
Cure Sword!

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.850
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:27.530
Dokidoki Precure!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:30.630
Precures...

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:33.370
After today, you'll be out of our way for good!

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.450
A pincer attack!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.880
What, is that all?

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.450
Girls!

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:56.400
Heads up!

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:06.040
Don't worry, Ai, we'll take care of those nasty, naggy ladies for you.

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.140
Good look for ya!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.210
More like you're brimming with <i>lame</i>!

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:15.470
Who needs that love junk when it always dies out in the end?

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:18.450
Love... is not junk!

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:22.730
And it never dies!

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.890
Love comes from belief.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:27.870
So as long as I believe in Ai...

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.320
there's no limit to my love!

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:31.890
Shaddup.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.330
Ai!

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:43.230
Open your eyes!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:44.220
Ai!

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:52.280
Ai's crying just gives us more Egogy.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:00.820
Watch out!

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:08.120
Girls!

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.770
We'll handle this!

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:12.040
Cure Heart, you save Ai!

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.670
Come here, Ai!

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:19.620
Over my dead body!

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:29.880
Ai!

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:36.670
Ai!

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:37.830
Cure Heart!

00:14:58.110 --> 00:15:00.200
Ai, I'm sorry.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:04.080
I didn't notice it until you had already become a Selfish.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:16.780
Even if you've forgotten us, I still believe in you.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:23.970
Because whenever I see your big smile, I can't help but feel overjoyed.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.550
So remember...

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:32.220
Hey, Ai...

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:36.020
remember the time when we all went to the plantation? {I hope so because it's been like a god damn week}

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:38.660
You saw how hard Aguri worked,

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.530
and you learned to love carrots along with her.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:44.140
Eat a bunch so you grow big and strong!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:50.350
It wasn't fun when you were going through your grumpy phase, though.

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:54.070
I didn't know what to do with you.

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:57.230
But when I was a baby,

00:15:57.230 --> 00:16:00.920
my mom and my family helped me grow up.

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:04.390
I wonder what kind of girl you'll grow up to be.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:09.580
It hasn't been long, but we've been through a lot together.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:13.940
When I was sad after Regina left us,

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:16.240
you cheered me up.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:19.130
When you first said "Gweat,"

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:22.430
when you caused that mess at school,

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.340
Rikka,

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.180
Alice,

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.080
Makopi,

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.030
Aguri,

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:27.210
the fairies,

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.010
and the shopkeeper...

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:31.880
all came together to help out.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:38.430
And do you remember the day we first met?

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.620
Mana...

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.010
Ai...

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:09.890
Mana!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.150
Ai, I love you! {Daww.}

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.270
Kyupirappa!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.510
Cure Heart!

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:29.300
Ai!

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:32.110
My power's gone!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.570
Time to am-scray—

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:37.770
Blood Ring, full power!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:41.290
Ooh, neat!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.790
We can do this!

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:43.950
Ai!

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:48.320
Precure Dress Up!

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.520
Kyupirappa!

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:28.360
Love's trump card,

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.780
Cure Ace!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.970
Eat this!

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:36.150
Beautify!

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:38.640
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:47.200
Kyupirappa!

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:52.610
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.320
Ace Shot!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.880
Bang!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.650
Wow!

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:04.160
That's Ai's power when she's completely recovered her love!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.900
Useless cretins!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:18.610
Super Bel!

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:24.480
Now that Ai has her love back, we have nothing to fear!

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:27.350
Magical Lovely Pad!

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:46.380
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:59.410
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:22.270
But I was supposed to be Numero Uno!

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.470
We'll remember this!

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.810
Let's go, meathead!

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:41.680
She's sound asleep.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:43.490
Well, today was a big day.

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:46.680
With Ai's power on our side,

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.200
we may be able to defeat King Selfish.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:54.900
Ai's smile alone may carry all the power we need.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.490
It certainly might.

00:20:56.490 --> 00:21:00.240
The time for our battle against King Selfish may be drawing near.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.710
And when it comes...

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:05.780
I'll be able to see Regina again.

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:12.620
Oh boy...

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:16.450
If we're getting called all the way back to Trump Kingdom...

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.200
Then we're getting another lecture?

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:20.830
Shut your mouths. He can hear.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:29.770
You stooges really are helpless without me, huh?

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.740
That voice...

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:57.940
Regina!

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:02.050
<i>Princess</i> Regina, remember?

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:04.920
{ED}

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:09.040
We've gotten a lot stronger!

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:11.810
We've mastered the Lovely Pad!

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:15.210
The time has come to bring the fight to King Selfish!

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:17.620
We can finally take back Trump Kingdom!

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:19.750
And we can meet Regina once more!

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:21.090
But how do we get there?

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:23.390
Joe can take us there, it seems.

00:22:23.390 --> 00:22:24.460
Wait, him?

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:25.560
Why is he here?

00:22:27.020 --> 00:22:28.630
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:31.600
We're Here to See You!

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:31.600
We're Here to See You!

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:33.760
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
